Error [E0960]: `settings` is not a module namespace
  --> tests/ui/module_unknown_namespace.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     settings.dev: Env {
    |     ^^^^^^^^
 Why: a module contributes to the reserved namespaces `env` (a dev environment), `system` (a whole machine), `image` (a disk image), `fleet` (a host fleet), and `vmtest` (a VM test)
 Fix: begin the contribution with `env`, `system`, `image`, `fleet`, or `vmtest`
